      "A SIEM centralizes logs/events, correlates them into alerts (rules + anomaly/ML detection), and feeds a SOC team + SOAR for automated response. Map detections to MITRE ATT&CK; tune to cut noise; measure MTTD/MTTR. Add EDR/XDR telemetry from endpoints.",
